{%- comment -%}
  Compact PayFac recurring-subscription disclosure.
  ==================================================
  Shared by sections/eyewipes-offer-page.liquid, sections/freshwipes-offer-page.liquid
  and sections/earwipes-offer-page.liquid. Rendered once beside every purchase
  button that can submit the RoutineCare cart directly (the hero Add to Cart
  button and the bottom-of-page "final offer" button; NOT the anchors that only
  scroll back to the hero, and NOT the sticky bar, which is a shortcut for the
  hero button rather than an independent purchase path).

  This snippet never computes a price, a selling plan or a currency. The two
  amount placeholders are filled in — and the whole block shown or hidden — by
  the page's own JS, from the exact same Kaching-rendered price string the
  sticky bar already uses. See "PAYFAC DISCLOSURE" in the page's .js file.

  Params:
    frequency      — accepted for backward compatibility with existing render
                     calls, but no longer used in the copy below.
    manage_url     — required. "Manage subscription" link target.
    recurring_copy — optional. Overrides the "then [amount] ___ until cancelled"
                     phrase. Defaults to the original wording ("with delivery
                     every month") so callers that don't pass it (EarWipes) are
                     unaffected. The World Animal Week EyeWipes/FreshWipes offer
                     pages pass "again in one month and every month thereafter"
                     to match the approved design's disclosure text.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign recurring_copy = recurring_copy | default: 'with delivery every month' -%}

<p class="pfd-disclosure" data-pfd-disclosure>
  RoutineCare automatic refills. <span data-pfd-today>&nbsp;</span> charged today, then <span data-pfd-recurring>&nbsp;</span> {{ recurring_copy }} until cancelled. No trial. Cancel anytime: <a href="{{ manage_url }}" class="pfd-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Manage subscription</a>.
</p>
